    ("Units", "units_aircraft", "Aircraft: Units (Site Default)", "select", "The unit set the Aircraft pages start with for anyone who has not chosen their own (in the Display menu, for this service or overall). Aviation uses feet, knots, nautical miles and feet per minute. Standard means the Site Default above (Settings > Home Page and Live Map).", {"choices": [("", "Standard"), ("imperial", "Imperial: feet, mph, miles, F"), ("aero", "Aeronautical: feet, knots, nautical miles, C"), ("metric", "Metric: meters, km/h, kilometers, C")]}),
